;; The two mechanisms this component reaches, as declared capability grants.
;; Source names them `clock/now` and `entropy/draw`; the policy names their
;; compiler wire ids (7 and 23) from amu's capability-catalog.edn. ADR-q9:
;; a clock or an entropy source crosses as a declared capability import and is
;; not a reason to keep the component in Clojure.
{:allow #{[:cap/call 7] [:cap/call 23]}}
